  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fourniture de services de soins vitaux en sant&#xE9; maternelle et reproductive aux populations affect&#xE9;es par la crise soudanaise.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide sexual and reproductive health assistance to host community members, refugees, returnees, and internally displaced persons in Bamingui-Bangoran, Haute-Kotto, and Vakaga. This UNFPA project provides access to essential sexual and reproductive health services, including through the procurement of inter-agency emergency reproductive health kits. This project provides humanitarian assistance to 24,800 people, including 14,400 women, 2,100 men, 8,300 children, and including 250 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
